      "id": "file:src/threat_report_agent/mechanism_completeness.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "mechanism_completeness.py",
      "filePath": "src/threat_report_agent/mechanism_completeness.py",
      "summary": "机制投影的共享语义完整度打分：按 target / inputs / transformation_or_control / conditions / outputs / consumers / side_effects / evidence_ids 八个字段加权计分，并把 UNKNOWN、通用占位符与纯导航性短语排除在「语义证据」之外。",
      "tags": ["语义打分", "完整度", "机制投影", "质量门"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "用 FIELD_WEIGHTS 常量表驱动加权，另设 _GENERIC_PLACEHOLDER_MARKERS 与 _NAVIGATION_MARKERS 黑名单，防止占位文本把 candidate 机制刷到满分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/threat_report_agent/mechanism_ready.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "mechanism_ready.py",
      "filePath": "src/threat_report_agent/mechanism_ready.py",
      "summary": "机制就绪 façade：inspect_mechanism_ready 从机制投影 mapping 读取分层就绪度（completeness / persist_how_recovered / claim_eligible / critical_ready / missing），其中 critical_ready 会额外排除 status 为 CANDIDATE 的行，因此 CANDIDATE 永远不会被计为 critical_ready。",
      "tags": ["报告就绪", "façade", "机制", "claim"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "MechanismReady 是 frozen dataclass，各字段互相独立：persist_how_recovered 可以为真而 critical_ready 仍为假；claim_eligible 来自 coverage，不由完整度反推。这个 façade 刻意不跑 ClaimGate、目录评估或报告 FUN-dump 过滤。"
    },
